## What's in the scene

| Part | Geometry | Details |
|---|---|---|
| **Cup body** | Open `CylinderGeometry` (tapered) | Wider at top (1.15) than bottom (0.85) |
| **Bottom** | Thin solid cylinder | Caps the base |
| **Foot ring** | Open cylinder | Creates a slight lip under the cup |
| **Rim** | `TorusGeometry` | Horizontal ring at the top edge |
| **Handle** | `TubeGeometry` along a `CatmullRomCurve3` | Smooth C-shaped curve attached to the side |
| **Coffee** | Flat `CircleGeometry` | Dark glossy disc near the rim |
| **Ground** | Large circle | Receives shadows |

