## What's included

| Feature | Details |
|---|---|
| **Zebra model** | Built from ~20 primitives (boxes, cones, spheres, cylinders) — body, chest, rump, neck, head, snout, 4 legs with hooves, tail with tuft, mane, ears, eyes |
| **Stripe texture** | Procedurally generated via Canvas 2D — vertical stripes + wavy horizontal overlay on a cream base |
