## What this demo includes

| Feature | Details |
|---|---|
| **Door** | Wooden door with 4 decorative panels, metal handle/lever, and visible hinges |
| **Door frame** | Left/right jambs, head trim, and a metal threshold sill |
| **Walls & floor** | Room context with a wall opening, grid-lined floor, and fog |
| **Lighting** | Directional sun, fill light, point light, and a warm glow that intensifies as the door opens |
| **Animation** | Door smoothly swings open and closed on a sine-wave cycle |
| **Interactivity** | Orbit controls — drag to rotate, scroll to zoom |
| **Rendering** | Shadow maps, ACES filmic tone mapping, antialiasing |

Just save it as `index.html` and open in any modern browser — no build step needed.

