| **Earth texture** | NASA Blue Marble image loaded from CDN |
| **Bump mapping** | Topology data gives subtle 3D terrain relief |
| **Atmosphere** | Custom GLSL shader creating a blue rim-glow via additive blending |
| **Starfield** | 6 000 randomly scattered points |
| **Orbit controls** | Click-drag to rotate, scroll to zoom, with damping |
