## What this creates

| Feature | Implementation |
|---|---|
| **Dome** | ~60 individual `BoxGeometry` blocks arranged in 8 latitudinal rings on a hemisphere of radius 2.5 |
| **Entrance tunnel** | 6-ring arched corridor extending outward from the dome base |
| **Snow ground** | Large `CircleGeometry` disc with snow drifts scattered around the base |
| **Night sky** | Dark background + 600 random star `Points` |
| **Lighting** | Moonlit `DirectionalLight` (casts soft shadows), cool `AmbientLight`, warm `PointLight` fill |
| **Interactivity** | `OrbitControls` with damping — drag to rotate, scroll to zoom |
| **Animation** | Subtle block shimmer oscillation |

Open the file in any modern browser — no build step needed. Three.js loads from the jsDelivr CDN via import map.

