## What's in this demo

| Feature | Details |
|---|---|
| **Kangaroo model** | Built entirely from `SphereGeometry`, `CapsuleGeometry`, and `BoxGeometry` primitives — body, head, snout, nose, eyes, ears (outer + inner), segmented tail, muscular hind legs with foot pads, and small front arms |
| **Materials** | Three-tone fur (base, dark, light belly patch), dark nose/pads, white eyes with pupils |
| **Lighting** | Warm directional sun with soft shadows, cool rim light, ambient fill |
| **Environment** | Green ground plane with fog, scattered grass tufts |
| **Animation** | Continuous gentle hop with body tilt and tail sway |
| **Controls** | `OrbitControls` — drag to rotate, scroll to zoom |

Open the file in any modern browser — no build step or server required (it loads Three.js from jsDelivr CDN).

