```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Lantern</title>
<style>
  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  body { background: #000; overflow: hidden; }
