## What's in the scene

| Part | Geometry | Material |
|---|---|---|
| **Main tube** | Long cylinder | Dark metallic |
| **Objective housing** | Wider cylinder + lens + rim | Brass + translucent blue glass |
| **Focuser** | Cylinder with 4 adjustment knobs | Brass |
| **Eyepiece** | Small cylinder with brass ring | Dark matte |
| **Finder scope** | Small cylinder on brackets | Dark metallic + glass lens |
| **Decorative bands** | Two torus rings | Brass |
| **Dovetail saddle** | Box | Dark metal |
| **Mount** | Pillar + base with brass trim | Dark metal + brass |
| **Counterweight** | Cylinder on shaft | Brass |
| **Background** | 2000-point starfield + dark ground plane | Emissive points |

**Controls:** Orbit with left-click drag, zoom with scroll, pan with right-click. The telescope gently sways and stars subtly twinkle.

