## What's included

| Feature | Detail |
|---|---|
| **Double helix backbones** | Two `TubeGeometry` curves following CatmullRom splines, offset by 180° |
| **Base-pair rungs** | Cylinders connecting the two strands with color-coded nucleotide spheres (A–T = red/blue, G–C = green/gold) |
| **60 base pairs** | Randomly assigned from the four complementary pairs |
| **Bloom post-processing** | `UnrealBloomPass` gives everything a soft bioluminescent glow |
| **Floating particles** | 600 ambient particles slowly rotating around the helix |
| **Decorative glow ring** | Pulsing torus encircling the helix midsection |
| **Breathing animation** | Nucleotide spheres gently pulse in a traveling wave |
| **Orbit controls** | Drag to rotate, scroll to zoom, auto-rotates when idle |
| **Responsive** | Handles window resize correctly |

Open the file in any modern browser — no build step or server required.

