## What you get

| Feature | Detail |
|---|---|
| **Body** | Stretched spheres with brown fur and lighter chest |
| **Face** | White facial mask, pink snout, black nose |
| **Eyes** | Large white sclera, brown iris, black pupil, specular highlight — they **track the camera** |
| **Ears** | Furred with white inner ear, occasional **twitch** animation |
| **Tail** | 18 alternating dark/light segments forming a **ringed tail** with wag animation |
| **Limbs** | Cylindrical arms/legs with dark hands and feet |
| **Animations** | Idle breathing, tail wag, ear twitch, eye tracking, subtle leg shifts |
| **Environment** | Green ground plane, scattered rocks, fog, multi-light setup with shadows |
| **Controls** | OrbitControls — drag to rotate, scroll to zoom |

Just save and open in any modern browser — no build step needed.

