|---|---|
| **Glass Material** | `MeshPhysicalMaterial` with `transmission: 0.97`, `ior: 1.52`, attenuation color & distance for realistic refraction |
| **28 Marbles** | Randomized sizes (0.25–0.7), 16-color palette, scattered + some stacked |
