```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Brass Key Ring</title>
<style>
* { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
body { background: #1a1a2e; overflow: hidden; }
