This creates a **3D brass sextant arc** featuring:

- **Main arc body** — a golden torus segment spanning ~56°, with realistic brass `MeshPhysicalMaterial` (high metalness, subtle clearcoat)
- **Tick marks** — 61 graduated ticks along the outer edge (major every 10°, mid every 5°, minor every 1°), all in varying brass tones
- **Black inlay** — a dark strip behind the ticks for contrast, mimicking real engraved scales
- **Inner index dots** — small brass spheres at 10° intervals on the inner edge
- **Frame backing plate** — an extruded brass frame with beveled edges
- **Center pin** — a polished brass pivot point
- **Studio lighting** — three-point lighting (key/fill/rim) plus a `RoomEnvironment` for realistic metallic reflections
- **Orbit controls** — drag to rotate, scroll to zoom

