## What's in the scene

| Element | Description |
|---|---|
| **Gnomon** | The iconic sundial "line" — a thin brass rod angled at ~23.5° with triangular flanking plates, pivoting from a sphere |
| **Dial plate** | A brass cylinder with 12 hour markers (larger at quarter-hours), decorative concentric rings, and cardinal direction dots |
| **Pedestal** | A dark stone base the dial sits on |
| **Animated sun** | A directional light orbits slowly, casting a real-time shadow and a visual shadow-line on the dial face |
| **Brass material** | High metalness (0.92), warm gold color (`#b5a642`), with a procedural environment map for realistic reflections |
| **Controls** | Orbit camera with damping, clamped to stay above the ground |

