| Element | Details |
|---|---|
| **Lantern body** | LatheGeometry with a rounded-cylinder profile, semi-transparent warm paper material |
| **Ribs** | 12 thin vertical cylinders mimicking traditional bamboo ribs |
| **Rings & band** | Top, bottom, and middle torus rings in dark wood/bronze |
| **Handle** | Two curved tubes arching above the lantern |
| **Inner glow** | A warm `PointLight` (orange) with subtle flicker animation |
| **18 fireflies** | Small emissive spheres with organic floating paths, individual flicker, and 8 carrying their own point lights |
| **Ambient dust** | 300 softly drifting particles for atmosphere |
| **Animation** | Gentle lantern sway, glow pulsing, firefly drift + flicker, all driven by `Math.sin`/`Math.cos` |

