```

## What's Inside

| Feature | Detail |
|---|---|
| **Bonsai Tree** | Recursively branched via `CatmullRomCurve3` tubes — 6 levels deep, with a secondary trunk for organic asymmetry |
| **Firefly Leaves** | Glowing spheres clustered at branch tips with per-firefly random **phase**, **speed**, and **color** from a curated green/gold palette |
| **Bloom Post-Processing** | `UnrealBloomPass` gives everything a soft neon halo |
| **Point Lights** | Each leaf-cluster firefly carries its own `PointLight` for real-time area glow |
| **Ambient Fireflies** | 40 free-floating particles orbit the tree with gentle sine-wave drift |
| **Bonsai Pot** | Tapered cylinder + torus rim + soil disc + moss patches |
| **Interaction** | `OrbitControls` with auto-rotate, damping, and zoom limits |
| **Atmosphere** | Exponential fog + dark background + ACES filmic tone mapping |

Open the file in any modern browser — no build step needed. Drag to orbit, scroll to zoom.

